cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lewdex in your work, please cite it."
title: Lewdex
abstract: >-
  Automatic tagging of Eagle 4 art libraries (anime, cartoon and furry art), fully offline: every
  image, animation and video is read by two AI taggers (PixAI Tagger v1.0 and Hydra 3.5) and the
  merged tags are written back into Eagle.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/edlmar/Lewdex
authors:
  - family-names: Edelmers
    given-names: Edgars
    email: edgars.edelmers@disroot.org
keywords:
  - image tagging
  - auto-tagging
  - anime
  - furry art
  - Eagle
